      "key":"qualification_and_closure_bounds",
      "statement":"Qualification is limited to actually evaluated revisions, envelopes, branches and populations. Mechanical document checks and source-linked Reviewer evaluation are bound together without treating either as the other or structural checking as semantic truth. A closed indeterminate result or review event satisfies no unresolved obligation. Work-item closure applies to the selected branch. The trace describes twenty-six representative-trial obligations and twenty-four application conditions as applications of other traced or imported rules, not new rules.",
