      "key":"work_result_value_consumption",
      "statement":"Only successful lawful activation produces a Worker result. Activation refusal returns its imported cause/core value to assigning authority or declared carrier, creating no activation or Worker result. Known activation-time capability, authority, stale/ambiguous basis or topology mismatch is refusal, never a synthetic work result. Imported ACTIVATION grounds exclusively select availability values. candidate_ready supplies exact candidate/transition evidence for deciding required review, not accept. refused names its prohibition/refusal counterexample for basis verification and existing-authority application. incomplete names every unperformed evaluation as having no result, every undecidable performed evaluation as retaining its own indeterminate, and whether bounded execution ended first; incomplete itself is falsified, never indeterminate, and reactivation requires current authority. Authority re-entry returns to the named decision owner; basis re-entry revalidates the basis lock before any further activation. Results reference existing carriers of current computed classification, evidence, residual judgments and original rulings without reconstructing unchanged C/J/O; consumers check applicability/invalidators, revising only affected results while preserving originals and supported surviving claims.",
