      "key":"attention_cycle_obligations",
      "statement":"While the frontier is nonempty, finite dependency-ready activations fit assigned actors and exact outcome/basis; assurance-independent evaluations remain free of unclosed peer results. Await decision-relevant input only when no other authorised decision is ready. Record every closed result, triage, residual and invalidation; use only declared conjunctions/translations, current-mandate priority/boundary decisions and affected-result invalidation. Stop only with every mandatory evaluation closed or every remaining residual explicitly retained by governing authority consistently with the claim; closure alone is not satisfaction. Recursion follows declared dependencies/bounded refinement, not undifferentiated copies of every frame. Ledger entries for severity, priority, boundary effect, disposition and next action remain distinct. Every result returns through an explicit relation, carrying its closed result/source routes rather than hidden reasoning; no result itself activates another frame or authorises continuation.",
