      "statement":"Finite engagement evaluations organise specialist coverage, not whole-workspace containment. Executive handles exact method/project/work basis; cone/configuration challenged by Worker/Reviewer; family/seam configuration while each frame owns its evaluation; conjunction/priority/boundary/disposition; checkpoint/continuation under existing authority; and missing-frame/topology response under pressure from any frame. Worker handles bounded realisation/self-review and candidate/transitions, using accepted design, material capability/foundation comparison and implementation/environment/proof inputs. User-outcome and full authoritative installed-path evaluations use Worker execution/self-review and Reviewer where independent assurance applies, with respectively user-acceptance Product/requirement/UX/identity/install/acceptance inputs and end-to-end composition/authority/lifecycle/persistence/recovery/replay/negative-reachability inputs. Interface-population integration and module-law unit evaluations use Worker/Reviewer according to claim, actual participant/carrier/state/configuration/failure/recovery and ontology/carrier/module-contract/algebra/calculation/state-machine/invariant/bounded-combination inputs. Obsolete/rival paths require Worker deletion evidence and required Reviewer exact-subject challenge using distinct production-closure and assurance/source-closure graphs plus package/consumer/mutation/sabotage/reconstruction/history inputs. Reviewer owns required independent exact-subject assessment/triage with live assurance and Product severity scale. Inventory derives from method/domain/outcome/history/dependencies/workspace and preserves every required unknown/uncovered/conditional/conflicted/authority-excluded residual. Visibility is not coverage: every material evaluation needs capable frame, admissible evidence and semantic/decision owners; every material construction/transformation/admission/publication/mutation also needs existing operatio